      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "What do you know about electric cars?",
      "body": "<p>Why do people buy them?</p><p>Are they cheaper to run?</p><p style=\"color:#ffdd00;text-align:center;font-size:38px;font-weight:700;margin-top:22px\">Opinion &mdash; Reason &mdash; Evidence</p>",
      "notes": "Open-class discussion. Elicit freely, no right or wrong answers. The yellow O-R-E label under the opening question anchors how students will structure their final answers."
    },
