      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:56px\">/ˈdʒʌŋkjɑːd/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">junkyard</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">The old machine sat in the <span class=\"box-word\">junkyard</span> for years. It was too broken to fix.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: word. Click 2: context. CCQ: Does a junkyard keep machines or take them apart?"
    },
