    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "discussion-structure",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Give Your Opinion",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Opinion</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">I think electric cars are better.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Reason</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">One reason is they cost less to run.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Evidence</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">For example, the text says batteries are cheaper.</td></tr></table><p style=\"color:#ffdd00;text-align:center;font-size:38px;font-weight:700;margin-top:22px\">Opinion &mdash; Reason &mdash; Evidence</p>",
      "notes": "Drill the Opinion-Reason-Evidence frame with the example. The yellow O-R-E label is required on every discussion-structure slide."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "discussion-language",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Agree, Disagree, Resolve",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Agree</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">I agree with you because…</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Disagree</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">I see your point, but…</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Resolution</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">So we both think… Let’s agree on that.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Interaction language: agree, disagree politely, then resolve."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "discussion-task",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#9b59b6",
      "body": "<p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:44px;font-weight:700\">Should everyone switch to electric cars?</p><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:35px\">Give your <strong style=\"color:#ffdd00\">opinion</strong>. Add a <strong style=\"color:#ffdd00\">reason</strong>. Use <strong style=\"color:#ffdd00\">evidence</strong> from the text.</p>",
      "notes": "Pairs or small groups discuss EVs vs petrol cars using O-R-E + agreement/disagreement/resolution. Timer: 8 minutes (480s, autostart). The timer plugin creates the pill UI automatically."
    }
  ]
